","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1948,"timestampLabel":"32:28","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- in a single extracurricular. Mrs. Campbell gave me and a lot of other people the chance to be in a group","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1957-287","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1957,"timestampLabel":"32:37","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- where everybody cares for each other and works as a team. Mrs. Campbell was extremely supportive of me","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-196-27","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":196,"timestampLabel":"3:16","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- like this are when we have to focus not on fear of change, but on who is truly best prepared to lead","transcriptMethod":"publisher-caption","official":false,"ingestion":"auto"},{"id":"cats-15880-tx-1967-288","meetingDate":"2026-05-19","meetingTitle":"Richland Bean Blossom School Board 5/19","sourceType":"video-transcript","sourceLabel":"Video Transcript","sourceUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","videoUrl":"https://catstv.net/m.php?q=15880","timestampSeconds":1967,"timestampLabel":"32:47","speakerName":null,"speakerConfidence":"unknown","text":"- the three years I had her and truly helped me gain mo